{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take ownership of real airspaces, learn their unique features, and coordinate with others to design your own procedures and arrival streams. Feel the rush of managing high-pressure situations at busy airspaces and the satisfaction of delivering aircraft on time without conflicts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn real-world airspaces, procedures, and phraseology. Start at smaller airports, earn endorsements, and climb the ranks to the world\u2019s busiest airspaces. Mimic real airport operations or develop your own strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate with neighboring controllers or split airspaces to tackle challenges too big for one person. Communicate effectively to maintain safe separation and efficient traffic flow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Autonomous</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control with confidence knowing that pilots will follow your commands precisely. No need for behind-the-scenes instructors or virtual pilots. Since pilots fly entirely on their own, even the busiest airspaces can reach peak traffic levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Efficient</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay organized with helpful tools:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flight Strip Bay -\u00a0Sort your flights and quickly lookup routes or vector assignments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flight Board - Gauge traffic levels and check flight status.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordination Page - Coordinate with neighboring controllers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your radar scope to fit your needs, displaying relevant airports, navaids, runway centerlines, procedures, etc. Start with labels and then gradually declutter as you naturally memorize the airspace.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1693800?t=1759717302","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759717302","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693800/ece82300f01f8b0f714f742bb7ef135103b363aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759717302","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693800/ece82300f01f8b0f714f742bb7ef135103b363aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759717302","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take ownership of real airspaces, learn their unique features, and coordinate with others to design your own procedures and arrival streams. Feel the rush of managing high-pressure situations at busy airspaces and the satisfaction of delivering aircraft on time without conflicts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn real-world airspaces, procedures, and phraseology. Start at smaller airports, earn endorsements, and climb the ranks to the world\u2019s busiest airspaces. Mimic real airport operations or develop your own strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate with neighboring controllers or split airspaces to tackle challenges too big for one person. Communicate effectively to maintain safe separation and efficient traffic flow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Autonomous</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control with confidence knowing that pilots will follow your commands precisely. No need for behind-the-scenes instructors or virtual pilots. Since pilots fly entirely on their own, even the busiest airspaces can reach peak traffic levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Efficient</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay organized with helpful tools:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flight Strip Bay -\u00a0Sort your flights and quickly lookup routes or vector assignments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flight Board - Gauge traffic levels and check flight status.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordination Page - Coordinate with neighboring controllers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your radar scope to fit your needs, displaying relevant airports, navaids, runway centerlines, procedures, etc. Start with labels and then gradually declutter as you naturally memorize the airspace.</p>","developers":["Ethan McMichael"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693800/443f99fea1b40ada075fe936f2c010541e922203/header.jpg?t=1759717302","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1693800/861274/001e2e55289ef0415088391058a36b71fb854f17/1751020540/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743456144","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1693800/861274/001e2e55289ef0415088391058a36b71fb854f17/1751020540/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743456144","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1693800/861274/001e2e55289ef0415088391058a36b71fb854f17/1751020540/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743456144","id":257120706,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120706/movie480.mp4?t=1743456144","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25712070